<title>NETHERLANDS: BIOGROND 1996 NET MARGINALLY LOWER.</title>
<headline>BIOGROND 1996 NET MARGINALLY LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)			     0.20 vs    0.29</p>
<p>    Net investment result (profit) (guilders) 463,000 vs 474,000</p>
<p>    Positive property revaluation (guilders)   89,000 vs 463,000</p>
<p>NOTE - &quot;Green&quot; investment fund Biogrond NV said the shortage</p>
<p>of environmentally-friendly investment projects, combined with</p>
<p>hefty demand from investors put pressure on returns.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
